data: {"id": "b6598c37aa6f43f1-thinking-parallel_evidence-847", "run_id": "b6598c37aa6f43f1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=787 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [pod_spec_config] kubectl get po", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789073994642, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_808f3f369c6c4f51bd83cd06", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=787 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [pod_spec_config] kubectl get pod workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl -n aiops-case-07 -o yaml to verify command/args/resources\n[ ] [pod_previous_logs] kubectl logs workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl -n aiops-case-07 --previous --tail=100 to extract crash logs\n[ ] [pod_events_recent] kubectl events for the pod to check for Liveness Probe failed or BackOff\n[ ] [observability-gate-1-topology] query_pod_topology for controller/service/node/container relationships\n[~] [pod_describe_status_exit] kubectl describe pod workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl -n aiops-case-07 to confirm Exit Code, Reason, Restart Count\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/b6598c37aa6f43f1-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/b6598c37aa6f43f1-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/b6598c37aa6f43f1-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

